OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval gold ring fails to sell
OL,4,Aat auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA medieval gold ring unearthed by two
OL,7,Fmetal detectorists has failed to sell
OL,8,Fat auction.
OL,10,FThe 14th Century gold seal ring of
OL,11,FMatilda was listed for auction by
OL,12,FNoonans Mayfair as part of a sale of
OL,13,Fjewellery, watches, silver and objects
OL,14,Fof vertu on Tuesday.
OL,16,FIt was discovered in a ploughed field
OL,17,Fnear Stoke Ash in Suffolk, in April
OL,18,F2024, by friends Aaron Pizzey, 30, and
OL,19,FJames Race, 39.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
