OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval gold ring fails to sell
OL,4,Aat auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe men said they were disappointed the
OL,7,Fring failed to meet its reserve bid of
OL,8,F#8,500, but they would attempt to
OL,9,Fauction it again in the future.
